;; tsutae-factory-r0 — 建材 + 設備 + デバイスBOM 台帳 (building + equipment + device-BOM ledger),
;; Datomic-style EDN. SSoT for every physical element of the 伝え handheld-device
;; cleanroom assembly line simulated by `kami-app-tsutae-factory` (ADR-2605261300).
;;
;; Same shape + shared `kotoba_gen.py`/SBOM/IFC toolchain as the sarutahiko
;; (ADR-2606013100) + giemon (ADR-2606010030) factory BOMs: each part becomes one
;; kotoba entity whose claims are kg/claim/part/* datoms (EAVT, ADR-2605312345); the
;; whole file also emits a CycloneDX SBOM.
;;
;; TWO BOMs live here, do not conflate:
;;   (1) the PLANT  — a SMALL cleanroom (Class 100k / ISO 8) light-electronics bay,
;;       groups A-E (shell) + G-L (MEP/site/raw) + F (SMT + assembly + test line).
;;       NOT a 180m steel truck plant — anti-mass-production (G12 ≤200 dev/8-hr line).
;;   (2) the DEVICE — group P, the SMARTPHONE itself: the full supply chain the repo
;;       was missing (SoC → PMIC → memory → PCB → passives → battery → display →
;;       camera → USB-C → cellular → chassis → fasteners). :part/supplier-did maps
;;       each component to its source actor (silicon / igata / hikari = internal;
;;       :representative = external, NOT a procurement-verified purchase).
;;
;; :part/group        A-foundation · B-steel-frame · C-roof · D-cladding ·
;;                    E-mep · F-equipment (SMT/assembly/test) · G-electrical ·
;;                    H-water · J-fire-safety · K-site · L-raw-materials ·
;;                    P-device (the smartphone BOM)
;; :part/procurement  :cots (off-the-shelf; :manufacturer + :purl) | :custom-fab
;;                    | :internal (made by another etzhayyim actor; :supplier-did)
;; :part/sim-feature  links a part to a render element id in factory.scene.json
;; :part/gate         the tsutae constitutional gate this device part satisfies
;; :part/sourcing     :representative — R0 design selection, NOT a verified purchase
;;                    or 確認申請/受電契約 decision. Confirm before buying/building.

{:bom/meta
 {:bom/of          "tsutae-factory-r0"
  :bom/revision    "v1"
  :bom/title       "伝え handheld-device cleanroom line — R0 building + equipment + device BOM"
  :bom/currency    "JPY"
  :bom/sourcing    :representative
  :bom/note        "R0 design BOM for a 48m x 30m Class-100k cleanroom SMT + final-assembly line producing the ≤200g open-SoC handheld of ADR-2605261300, PLUS the device BOM (group P) — the smartphone supply chain. Plant shell (A-E) + utilities (G/H/J) + site (K) + raw (L) as kami-genesis geometry; production equipment (F) = SMT line + assembly cells + display laminator + firmware flash + RF chamber + EOL bench. Device parts (P) carry :supplier-did (silicon/igata/hikari internal, else :representative external) + :gate. Manufacturer/MPN/qty/mass are representative R0 design figures, NOT a finalized purchase, 確認申請, 消防同意, 受電/受水契約, or 電波法/技適 certification. Open-SoC only (G9); proprietary SoC is absent by construction (N1). R3 community-scale ≤10,000/yr is Council + LANDS.md gated."}

